  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T K.128 describes metal oxide varistor (MOV) construction, non-linearity modelling, impedance properties, equivalent circuit, element temperature distribution, time factors, degradation and failure modes, operation states and application examples. These surge protective components (SPCs) are intended for the protection of exchange and outdoor equipment, subscriber or customer equipment and telecommunication lines from surges.</abstract>
